Section: 3 EXPERIMENTS
Text: Query-bag Matching To verify the effectiveness of our pro- posed models, We design a new query-bag matching based baseline. We concatenate the questions in the bag to form a new long “ques- tion”, then the hCNN model is applied to measure the matching 3https://data.quora.com/First-Quora-Dataset-Release-Question-Pairs 4The composed Quora dataset and more detailed experiments are in https://github.

