Section: 3 EXPERIMENTS
Text: 3 EXPERIMENTS 3.1 Dataset We conduct experiments on two datasets: AliMe and Quora. The Al- iMe dataset is collected from the AliMe intelligent assistant system and the Quora dataset is composed of a public dataset. AliMe For the AliMe service in E-commerce, we collect 8,004 query-bag pairs to form our dataset. Negative sampling is also an important part of the matching model. For each query, we use the Lucene2 to retrieval the top-20 most similar questions from the whole question candidates.

