=== Generated Answer (model draft; check against evidence) ===
Yes, the query-bag matching model uses neural networks.

The proposed QBM model uses hCNN, a CNN-based matching model in which a query and a bag question are fed into CNNs respectively, and a cross-attention matrix between them is fed into another CNN to obtain the interaction representation [4]. The model also includes a TF-IDF based bag representation matched with the query via hCNN [5], and the conclusion notes that researchers have adopted deep neural networks to model matching relationships in this line of work [1].
